          {
            "uri": "https://github.com/google-agentic-commerce/a2a-x402/blob/main/spec/v0.2",
            "description": "x402 payments on marketplace-invoke (standalone flow). Profile deviation: this hub verifies the transfer on chain and never settles, so x402.payment.payload must carry the settle txHash of a USDC transfer to the payTo it quoted.",
